1. She has a grandmother, referred to as "Nana Elia," whom she is close to and was worried about when she fell and went to the hospital. (Verbatim: "my nan, you know, Nana Elia, our beloved, and she went to the doctors today and she fell... I was very much a mess.")
2. Her grandmother is in her 90s and is described as having strong bones. (Verbatim: "she's like 90-something... she's very heckin' strong.")
